{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２.２２\n乃木坂46\nHAPPY BIRTHDAY♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということでっ！\n乃木坂46、ついに１歳のお誕生日を迎えましたヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあ～あっという間や！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の今頃はイオンツアーで全国飛び回ってたな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ最近のことの様な気がするけど、\nもうあれから一年が経つんだね(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は一年後にまさかアリーナでライブができるなんて思ってもみなかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして33人全員で一周年おめでとう！\nって祝えるって、本当に幸せな事だと思う(>ω<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまでこれたのは\nいつも応援してくださるファンの皆さん、\n最高のステージを作ってくださるスタッフの皆さん、\n陰ながらいつも支えてくれる家族、\nそしていつも一緒に坂を登ってくれるメンバーのみんな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に支えられています( ^ω^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当にありがとう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二年目も、突っ走っていきます！\n乃木坂46！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\( ^ω^ )/\\( ^ω^ )/\\( ^ω^ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなついてきてね～！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさ、昨日のライブほんと楽しかった(o^^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番綺麗な景色で、\n一番大きなステージで、\n一番熱気が凄かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと最高"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜのときにでっかいバルーン投げたり(o^^o)\n海流のときにカモメ隊として２階席に行ったり(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上のお客さんにも楽しんでもらいたくて♡！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カモメ隊のときにみんなハイタッチしてくれてありがとー\\( ^ω^ )/\n予想外でびっくりしたけど楽しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！あとサインボール受け取ってくれた方いますかー＼(^o^)／？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事にしてくれると嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてっ\n５thシングル アンダー楽曲\n「13日の金曜日」\nをサプライズ初披露させていただきました～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルとは違ってPOPで可愛くて楽しくなるような曲調だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌詞も恋する乙女って感じで可愛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで衣装はこれっ！\nちょっと見にくいけど(´Д` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も～めっちゃ可愛くて\n1番好きな衣装になりました(´>ω<｀)♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも黄色と紫があるよ！\nまた写メ載せるね(´◡͐`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の乃木どこでPV初披露するので、\n楽しみにしててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は最高の一日をありがとう(o^^o)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、こうして楽しい思い出をたくさん残していきたいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/02/23/9899349/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"}